{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32586","headline":"秋夕山斋即事 · 刘沧","name":"秋夕山斋即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衡门无事闭苍苔，篱下萧疎野菊开。\n半夜秋风江色动，满山寒叶雨声来。\n鴈飞关塞霜初落，书寄乡闾人未回。\n独坐高窗此时节，一弹瑶瑟自成哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}